1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,050
Organise time around the work you actually
do.

2
00:00:04,033 --> 00:00:06,176
New projects start with an empty list.

3
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:09,278
In Subcategories, type a name that fits your
work.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,068
Choose the project and your new subcategory.

5
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:15,984
Add the time and a description of what you
did.

6
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:19,501
The label and description stay with the
entry.

7
00:00:19,767 --> 00:00:23,799
The same subcategory is available in the
timer and in exports.

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,205
Start with a project. Add categories as you
need them.
